<navigation-bar title="谋马超博弈" back="{{true}}" color="black" background="#FFF"></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="page-shell" scroll-y type="list">
  <view class="header-card">
    <view class="header-top">
      <view>
        <text class="card-title">谋马超 · 铁骑谋弈</text>
        <text class="card-desc">使用【杀】指定目标后可与其谋弈：双方先各选一策，明牌公布。出招未被目标恰好化解，即攻城成功。</text>
      </view>
      <button class="clear-btn {{clearBtnDisabled ? 'clear-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bind:tap="handleClear">清空</button>
    </view>
    <view class="status-chips">
      <text class="chip-primary">你的出招：{{selectedAttackLabel}}</text>
      <text class="chip">目标策应：{{selectedDefenseLabel}}</text>
      <text class="{{verdictChipClass}}">{{verdictChipText}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">你的出招</text>
      <text class="chip">谋马超方</text>
    </view>
    <text class="section-desc">选择你打算执行的谋弈选项。</text>
    <view class="attack-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{attackOptions}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="attack-btn attack-btn--{{item.tone}} {{selectedAttack === item.id ? 'attack-btn--selected' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bind:tap="handleSelectAttack"
      >
        <view class="attack-btn-head">
          <text class="attack-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="attack-tone">{{item.toneLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="attack-reward">{{item.reward}}</text>
        <text class="attack-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">目标的策应</text>
      <text class="chip">目标方</text>
    </view>
    <text class="section-desc">猜测目标会如何应对，是谋弈的关键。</text>
    <view class="option-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{defenseOptions}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="option-btn {{selectedDefense === item.id ? 'option-btn--active' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bind:tap="handleSelectDefense"
      >
        <text class="option-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="option-desc">{{item.heroDesc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{resultVisible}}" class="verdict-card verdict-card--{{resultVerdict}}">
    <view class="verdict-header">
      <text class="verdict-title">{{resultTitle}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{resultVerdict === 'success'}}" class="verdict-badge">✓</text>
      <text wx:else class="verdict-badge">✗</text>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{resultVerdict === 'success'}}" class="verdict-reward">收益：{{resultReward}}</text>
    <text class="verdict-reason">{{resultReason}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">谋弈矩阵</text>
      <text class="chip">4 种组合</text>
    </view>
    <text class="section-desc">横向为你的出招，纵向为目标策应。亮色单元格为当前判定。</text>
    <view class="matrix">
      <view class="matrix-row matrix-row--head">
        <view class="matrix-corner"></view>
        <view wx:for="{{defenseOptions}}" wx:key="id" class="matrix-col">
          <text class="matrix-col-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:for="{{matrixRows}}" wx:key="attackId" class="matrix-row">
        <view class="matrix-corner matrix-corner--attack">
          <text class="matrix-corner-text">{{item.attackName}}</text>
        </view>
        <view
          wx:for="{{item.cells}}"
          wx:key="defenseId"
          class="matrix-cell matrix-cell--{{item.outcome}} {{item.isActive ? 'matrix-cell--active' : ''}}"
        >
          <text class="matrix-verdict">{{item.outcome === 'success' ? '成功' : '失败'}}</text>
          <text class="matrix-reward">{{item.reward}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <text class="section-title">战术提示</text>
    <view class="tips-list">
      <view wx:for="{{tips}}" wx:key="icon" class="tip-item">
        <view class="tip-icon">
          <text class="tip-icon-text">{{item.icon}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="tip-text">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-card">
    <text wx:if="{{selectedAttack !== null && selectedDefense === null}}" class="summary-text">
      已选你的出招「{{selectedAttackLabel}}」，等待选择目标的策应。
    </text>
    <text wx:elif="{{selectedAttack === null && selectedDefense !== null}}" class="summary-text">
      目标倾向「{{selectedDefenseLabel}}」，请选择你的出招进行谋弈。
    </text>
    <text wx:elif="{{selectedAttack !== null && selectedDefense !== null}}" class="summary-text">
      「{{selectedAttackLabel}}」对上「{{selectedDefenseLabel}}」——{{resultTitle}}，收益结算完毕。
    </text>
    <text wx:else class="summary-text">
      尚未出招。先想好这一刀想拿到什么，再猜对手怎么防。
    </text>
  </view>
</scroll-view>